From 562043f1ce74b0478492a1e7c7f203e79a7340bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gilles <62951130+VivaLaVent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:44:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Add a BLS Type #1 entry parser

bls_select() reads loader/entries/*.conf under a partition root, sorts entries as the Boot Loader Specification says and honours the default glob in loader/loader.conf. It has no PS5 SDK dependencies so tests/ builds it with host gcc. Nothing calls it yet.

Entries with more than one initrd are rejected because the loader has one initrd buffer. Version order follows systemd's strverscmp_improved(), so the order matches bootctl.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
